# M9 "İlk Kan": a Kargan mage casts Köz Oku (key 1, 600 ms cast: cast bar, spell_enter / spell_idle,
# then spell_shoot and the ember bolt flying to the target) at a Kül Çömezi from 11 m, then finishes
# it with the staff's ranged auto-attack (14 m).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m9_mage
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.3
clickon create.name
text Kozbilen
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded 1800
expect world+safezone+level1+alive
wait 200
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 11
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
expect world+outsidesafe
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
scene camera behind 26 8
wait 10
expect world+target+targetmonster
# 11 m is inside Köz Oku's 16 m: the cast starts where we stand.
key 1
waitfor world+casting 120
wait 12
screenshot 01_cast_bar.png
waitfor world+bolts1 120
wait 2
screenshot 02_ember_bolt.png
waitfor world+skillhits1 120
expect world+alive
key f
waitfor world+kills1 2400
wait 20
screenshot 03_kill.png
scene combatlog
quit
